---
title: "WoRMS drift report"
---
sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor U as user<br>tree-revision draft <br> scheduled
    participant LT as labeltree-db
    participant W as WoRMS API

    U->>LT: POST /trees/taxonomy/drift <br> 202 Accepted, task started
    LT->>LT: get list of AphiaIDs<br>in current tree revision
    loop for each AphiaID
        LT->>W: REQUEST:<br>AphiaRecordByAphiaID + <br>AphiaClassificationByAphiaID
        W-->>LT: current status, valid_AphiaID, lineage
        LT->>LT: new updated WORMS_RECORD <br> if there's been a change
    end
    LT->>LT: re-run placement checks for the whole tree
    LT->>LT: add new NODE_WARNINGS entry<br>for each node with new/different warnings
    U ->>LT: GET /trees/taxonomy/drift
    LT-->>U: nodes with current warnings
